  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & f(-1)=f(1) \\Rightarrow b=0 \\\\ & f(x)=a x^2+c \\quad \\Rightarrow f^{\\prime}(x)=2 a x\\end{aligned}$",
